# Build context hygiene: keep the image build fast and free of host artifacts.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/.tamagui
**/dev-dist
**/playwright-report
**/playwright-test-results
**/playwright
**/html
.stryker-tmp
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude
.cursor
.agents
.fallow
.evlog
.changeset
**/*.log
# Secrets must be injected at runtime, never copied into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
